}/* End custom CSS */</style>{"id":226,"slug":"returns-exchange","content":{"raw":"<img width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner-300x94.jpg 300w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner-1024x320.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner-1536x480.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner-600x188.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n    <h2>RETURNS & EXCHANGE<\/h2>\n<style>\n.custom-title{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    gap:20px;\n}\n.custom-title h2{\n    margin:0;\n    font-family:\"Jost\", Sans-serif;\n    font-size:22px;\n    font-weight:300;\n    color:#222222;\n    line-height:1;\n}\n.custom-title span{\n    width:80px;\n    height:0.5px;\n    background:#6d6e71;\n    display:block;\n}\n\/* Mobile Responsive *\/\n@media(max-width:767px){\n.custom-title{\n    gap:10px;\n}\n.custom-title h2{\n    font-size:14px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.custom-title span{\n    width:40px;\n    height:0.25px;\n}\n}\n<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t<p>At FIERRO, customer satisfaction is our top priority; our products are backed by a Consumer Guarantee, ensuring they are flawless and exactly as described online. Our goal is for you to love your FIERRO purchase every step of the way, so feel free to reach out if you have any questions or need assistance!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>FAULTY \/ WRONG ITEM SHIPPED<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you've received a faulty or incorrect item, don't worry! Contact us within 24 hours for assistance. Fill out our Contact Form for prompt assistance on Refunds and Exchanges. <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>RETURNS ACCEPTED UNDER THE FOLLOWING CONDITIONS<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you wish to return an item, just make sure to include a proof of purchase or receipt with your claim. Remember, the item should be in its\noriginal brand new condition - unused and with no damage to the jewelry or packaging. When shipping it back, be sure to pack it up well\nto keep it safe during transit. <\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>RETURNS NOT ACCEPTED UNDER THE FOLLOWING CONDITIONS<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>We do not accept returns for items accidentally damaged, those bought on sale or using a discount, unless you received a faulty product,\nin which case we will provide a full refund. For hygiene purposes, we're unable to take back earrings unless they're faulty, in which case we'll\ngladly refund you or exchange them. Please keep in mind that purchases made at one of our stockiest should be returned to them directly<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t<h2>RETURN PROCESS<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<p>Upon receipt of your return, we will inspect your item within 10 business days and it remains at the discretion of FIERRO as to whether the\nitem will be accepted for refund\/exchange based on the conditions above. Returns and exchanges are valid for orders placed within the UAE\nonly and Shipping charges are not refundable.<br><br>\nComplimentary gifts cannot be exchanged or returned for a refund, and will not be replaced if misplaced, lost or stolen. These items are not\ncovered by our warranty.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\n        <h2>LETS SOCIALIZE <\/h2>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/fierrojewellery\/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Instagram-Icon.svg\" alt=\"Instagram\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=61592874454475\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Facebook-Icon.svg\" alt=\"Facebook\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.tiktok.com\/@fierrojewellery\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/TikTok-Icon.svg\" alt=\"TitTok\"><\/a>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/971527794759\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/WhatsApp-Icon.svg\" alt=\"WhatsApp\"><\/a>\n<style>\n    .social-icons {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n}\n.social-icons a img {\n    width: 35px;\n    height: 35px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s;\n}\n.social-icons a img:hover{\n    scale: .9;\n    transition-duration: .1s;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col-social{\n        display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 13px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 25px!important;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-line {\n    width: 75px!important;\n    height: 1px;\n    background-color: #6D6E71;\n    justify-self: center;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px!important;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n .bsh-heading-social .bsh-title {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #222222;\n    margin: 0;\n    line-height: 1;\n}\n.bsh-heading-social .bsh-subtitle{\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #6d6e71;\n}\n@media (max-width: 767px) {\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-title {\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .social-icons a img {\n        width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s; \n    }\n    .social-icons a img {\n        width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    display: block;\n    transition-duration: .1s; \n    }\n    .social-icons {\n        gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-line {\n    width: 35px!important;\n    height: 0.25;\n    background-color: #6D6E71;\n    justify-self: center;\n}\n    .bsh-heading-social .bsh-text-col-social{\n        display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 5px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n}\n}\n<\/style>","rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"226\" class=\"elementor elementor-226\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad684b1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ad684b1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4db7f2b elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4db7f2b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-306\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner-300x94.jpg 300w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner-1024x320.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner-1536x480.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/soharon.co.uk\/dev-101\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/Return-Exchange-Page-Banner-600x188.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e6eb45 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8e6eb45\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-578ddb0 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"578ddb0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"custom-title\">\r\n    <span><\/span>\r\n    <h2>RETURNS & EXCHANGE<\/h2>\r\n    <span><\/span>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n.custom-title{\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:center;\r\n    gap:20px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title h2{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n    font-family:\"Jost\", Sans-serif;\r\n    font-size:22px;\r\n    font-weight:300;\r\n    color:#222222;\r\n    line-height:1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title span{\r\n    width:80px;\r\n    height:0.5px;\r\n    background:#6d6e71;\r\n    display:block;\r\n}\r\n\r\n\/* Mobile Responsive *\/\r\n@media(max-width:767px){\r\n\r\n.custom-title{\r\n    gap:10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title h2{\r\n    font-size:14px;\r\n    text-align: center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.custom-title span{\r\n    width:40px;\r\n    height:0.25px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n}\r\n<\/style>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b27b49 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6b27b49\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">At FIERRO, customer satisfaction is our top priority; our products are backed by a Consumer Guarantee, ensuring they are flawless and exactly as described online. Our goal is for you to love your FIERRO purchase every step of the way, so feel free to reach out if you have any questions or need assistance!<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eb10083 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"eb10083\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAULTY \/ WRONG ITEM SHIPPED<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cc17dd7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cc17dd7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">If you've received a faulty or incorrect item, don't worry! Contact us within 24 hours for assistance. Fill out our Contact Form for prompt assistance on Refunds and Exchanges. <\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3623cfa elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3623cfa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">RETURNS ACCEPTED UNDER THE FOLLOWING CONDITIONS<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d9fbd6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1d9fbd6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">If you wish to return an item, just make sure to include a proof of purchase or receipt with your claim. Remember, the item should be in its\noriginal brand new condition - unused and with no damage to the jewelry or packaging. When shipping it back, be sure to pack it up well\nto keep it safe during transit. <\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c7f673c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c7f673c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">RETURNS NOT ACCEPTED UNDER THE FOLLOWING CONDITIONS<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dba01c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dba01c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">We do not accept returns for items accidentally damaged, those bought on sale or using a discount, unless you received a faulty product,\nin which case we will provide a full refund. For hygiene purposes, we're unable to take back earrings unless they're faulty, in which case we'll\ngladly refund you or exchange them. Please keep in mind that purchases made at one of our stockiest should be returned to them directly<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8654a13 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8654a13\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">RETURN PROCESS<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b151c6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4b151c6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Upon receipt of your return, we will inspect your item within 10 business days and it remains at the discretion of FIERRO as to whether the\nitem will be accepted for refund\/exchange based on the conditions above. Returns and exchanges are valid for orders placed within the UAE\nonly and Shipping charges are not refundable.<br><br>\nComplimentary gifts cannot be exchanged or returned for a refund, and will not be replaced if misplaced, lost or stolen. These items are not\ncovered by our warranty.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f8c223 elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"3f8c223\" data-element_type